 "lines": [
  {
   "text": "On the night before he suffered, in an upper room they sat",
   "heard": 12,
   "words": 12,
   "error_s": 0.64,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "With the bread upon the table and their hearts were full of fear",
   "heard": 13,
   "words": 13,
   "error_s": 0.64,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "He said, I am going to the Father, but you will not be alone",
   "heard": 14,
   "words": 14,
   "error_s": 0.27,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "And he spoke a word of promise for the days when he'd be gone",
   "heard": 14,
   "words": 14,
   "error_s": 0.61,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "I will ask the Father, and he will give you another Advocate",
   "heard": 11,
   "words": 12,
   "error_s": 0.69,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "To be with you forever",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 0.7,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "The Spirit of truth",
   "heard": 4,
   "words": 4,
   "error_s": 0.57,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "I will not leave you as orphans; I am coming to you",
   "heard": 12,
   "words": 12,
   "error_s": 0.56,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "When the day of Pentecost had come, they were all together in one place",
   "heard": 14,
   "words": 14,
   "error_s": 0.78,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Suddenly a sound came from heaven like a rushing, violent wind",
   "heard": 11,
   "words": 11,
   "error_s": 0.72,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
